# GitHub language statistics (Linguist)
#
# NorthwindDB/ holds the sample database scripts (~8 MB of INSERT statements per
# DBMS). They are data for the samples, not source code of this project, but by
# byte count they outweigh the C# code more than ten to one - so without this
# GitHub reports the repository as "TSQL".
#
# linguist-vendored only excludes the files from the language bar; they are
# still in the repository, searchable and viewable as usual.
NorthwindDB/** linguist-vendored
